  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the garlic and ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the lentils, coco sugar, turmeric, cumin, salt, and pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Add 4 cups of water to the pot and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, for 30 minutes.",
    "Roast in the oven at 400 degrees for 20 minutes.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with chopped fresh herbs if desired."
